WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.040
A parent asks about breastfeeding. BHW Mimi listens. Two topics: respectful support and safe reduction of unnecessary waste.

2
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:23.100
RA 10028 sets rules for lactation stations. The institution is responsible. Mimi confirms the local space and trained contact.

3
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:34.000
Respect the parent's privacy and choice. With permission, connect them to confirmed support. Do not offer personal clinical advice.

4
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:44.740
The DOH circular limits unnecessary single-use plastics in specified settings, with phased coverage. Confirm the current directive.

5
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:55.560
Ask the supervisor about reusable lunch containers in the break area. Never independently remove or reuse sterile or necessary clinical supplies.

6
00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:09.140
Listen, confirm, support. Respect the parent and confirm local support. Reduce unnecessary waste according to guidance. Safe care comes first.
